_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a8137c1f-db0e-11ef-b4f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"a8137c20-db0e-11ef-8a2f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"a8137c21-db0e-11ef-a308-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建康","place_name_jianti_auto":"建康","resolved_place_entity_id":64,"start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"a8137c22-db0e-11ef-933d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"敦煌","place_name_jianti_auto":"敦煌","resolved_place_entity_id":335,"start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"a8137c24-db0e-11ef-a381-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"北魏统一北方的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0718"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"牧犍遣將軍沮渠旁周入貢于魏，魏主遣侍中古弼、尚書李順賜其侍臣衣服，幷徵世子封壇入侍。是歲，牧犍遣封壇如魏，亦遣使詣建康，獻雜書及敦煌趙𢾺撰甲寅元曆，幷求雜書數十種，帝皆與之。","content_fanyi":"北凉王沮渠牧犍派将军沮渠旁周向北魏进贡，北魏主拓跋焘派侍中古弼、尚书李顺赐给北凉侍从臣僚衣服，并征召北凉世子沮渠封坛到京师平城充当人质。这一年，北凉王沮渠牧犍派沮渠封坛前往北魏平城，又派使者到刘宋都城建康，进献各种书籍以及敦煌人赵𢾺所撰《甲寅元历》，并索求数十种杂书，宋文帝刘义隆都满足了他们。","content_jianti_auto":"牧犍遣将军沮渠旁周入贡于魏，魏主遣侍中古弼、尚书李顺赐其侍臣衣服，幷征世子封坛入侍。是岁，牧犍遣封坛如魏，亦遣使诣建康，献杂书及敦煌赵𢾺撰甲寅元历，幷求杂书数十种，帝皆与之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11380,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"a8137c10-db0e-11ef-bb40-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":5,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見上卷十年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a7f5377b-db0e-11ef-8fa6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見上卷十年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见上卷十年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"a8137c27-db0e-11ef-af34-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":442,"link_td_description":"李顺，字德正，赵郡平棘县人。北魏官员，出自赵郡李氏东祖，官至安西将军、散骑常侍、四部尚书。李顺曾多次出使北凉，并且一度受太武帝宠信，但因为多次收受贿赂而作出不实行为，太武帝在崔浩推波助澜下将李顺处死。","link_td_id":"Q10005048","link_td_number_id":6316684,"people_name":"李順","people_name_jianti_auto":"李顺","people_xingming":"李顺","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a8137c28-db0e-11ef-98c8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河西","place_name_jianti_auto":"河西","resolved_place_entity_id":224,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a8137c29-db0e-11ef-bff0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a8137c2a-db0e-11ef-96a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"涼州","place_name_jianti_auto":"凉州","resolved_place_entity_id":156,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"a8137c2b-db0e-11ef-9799-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"和龍","place_name_jianti_auto":"和龙","resolved_place_entity_id":1016,"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a8137c2c-db0e-11ef-8d39-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":4,"start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"a8137c2d-db0e-11ef-8bf9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"北魏统一北方的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0718"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事","人事"],"content":"李順自河西還，魏主問之曰：「卿往年言取涼州之策，朕以東方有事，未遑也。今和龍已平，吾欲卽以此年西征，可乎？」對曰：「臣疇昔所言，以今觀之，私謂不謬。然國家戎車屢動，士馬疲勞，西征之議，請俟他年。」魏主乃止。","content_fanyi":"北魏尚书李顺从北凉回国，北魏国主拓跋焘问他：“你当年说的攻取北凉的计策，我因为当时正对燕国用兵，没有来得及施行。如今和龙已经平定，我打算立即在今年西征，可以吗？”李顺回答说：“我当年所说的那些话，用今天的形势来检验，私下里自以为并没有错。然而国家战车屡次出动，东征西讨，士兵和战马都已疲惫不堪，西征的计划，请等到别的年份再说。”拓跋焘同意了。","content_jianti_auto":"李顺自河西还，魏主问之曰：「卿往年言取凉州之策，朕以东方有事，未遑也。今和龙已平，吾欲即以此年西征，可乎？」对曰：「臣畴昔所言，以今观之，私谓不谬。然国家戎车屡动，士马疲劳，西征之议，请俟他年。」魏主乃止。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11381,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a8137c26-db0e-11ef-a0f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"十四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"十四年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a810d052-db0e-11ef-8dd9-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（丁丑、四三七）","year_int":437},"message":"success","success":true}